{
  "name": "LOOPRA_WF003_Moderacion_Comentarios",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "loopra/comments",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-comments",
      "name": "Webhook (Entrada Comentario)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "loopra-comments-webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{$env.SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/clients",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "id",
              "value": "=eq.{{$json.body.client_id}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "select",
              "value": "tone_of_voice,industry"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{$env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer {{$env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "fetch-client-context",
      "name": "Leer Memoria del Cliente",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        400,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer {{$env.OPENAI_API_KEY}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"gpt-4o\",\n  \"response_format\": { \"type\": \"json_object\" },\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"Eres un moderador de redes sociales. Tu trabajo es analizar un comentario de un seguidor y generar una respuesta perfecta. \\nContexto del negocio: {{$json.data[0].industry}}.\\nTono de voz para responder: {{$json.data[0].tone_of_voice}}.\\n\\nDebes devolver un JSON exacto con dos campos:\\n1. 'sentiment': clasifica el comentario estrictamente como 'POSITIVE', 'NEUTRAL', 'NEGATIVE', o 'CRITICAL' (Critical es para insultos, demandas legales o quejas de salud graves).\\n2. 'ai_response': la respuesta redactada para publicar. Si es CRITICAL, la respuesta debe ser formal pidiendo que contacten por DM o email.\\nJSON Formato: { \\\"sentiment\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"ai_response\\\": \\\"...\\\" }\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Autor: {{$node['Webhook (Entrada Comentario)'].json.body.author_handle}}\\nComentario: '{{$node['Webhook (Entrada Comentario)'].json.body.comment_text}}'\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "openai-sentiment",
      "name": "ChatGPT Analista & Copywriter",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        600,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const analysis = JSON.parse(items[0].json.choices[0].message.content);\nconst inputBody = $node['Webhook (Entrada Comentario)'].json.body;\n\n// Lógica de Triaje de Riesgo\nlet response_status = 'PENDING_REVIEW';\nif (analysis.sentiment === 'POSITIVE' || analysis.sentiment === 'NEUTRAL') {\n  response_status = 'AUTO_PUBLISHED';\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    client_id: inputBody.client_id,\n    post_id: inputBody.post_id,\n    platform: inputBody.platform,\n    comment_id_ext: inputBody.comment_id_ext,\n    author_handle: inputBody.author_handle,\n    comment_text: inputBody.comment_text,\n    sentiment: analysis.sentiment,\n    ai_response: analysis.ai_response,\n    response_status: response_status\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "triage-logic",
      "name": "Lógica de Triaje (Riesgo)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{$env.SUPABASE_URL}}/rest/v1/post_comments",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{$env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer {{$env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{JSON.stringify($json)}}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "insert-comment-db",
      "name": "Guardar en Supabase",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.response_status}}",
              "value2": "AUTO_PUBLISHED"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "check-autopublish",
      "name": "Es Auto-Publicable?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Mock API Redes Sociales\nAquí iría el nodo HTTP de Instagram o TikTok para insertar el `$json.ai_response` como reply al comentario original.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300
      },
      "id": "mock-social-api",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1400,
        180
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook (Entrada Comentario)": {
